[gd_scene format=4 uid="uid://yiuybstlr4v4"]

; One variable: a GridMap the bake names. The bake merges the cells into the GridMap's
; `baked_meshes`, each with its own UV2, and the data names each by its index as a sub-instance.
; Every other lightmap scene names MeshInstance3D nodes, so none shows a wrong sub-instance or a
; GridMap that still draws its cells.

